00:08:40.830 --> 00:08:44.750
it's gonna be called far dirt or far grass.

204
00:08:44.750 --> 00:08:45.870
And then what we're gonna do

205
00:08:45.870 --> 00:08:47.470
is we're gonna take both of these.

