209
00:08:54.389 --> 00:08:58.360
So again, let's go over to the editor

210
00:08:58.360 --> 00:09:00.320
and let's go ahead and set this up

211
00:09:00.320 --> 00:09:01.559
by first coming up here.

212
00:09:01.559 --> 00:09:05.259
And we're gonna grab these two up here, right?

213
00:09:05.259 --> 00:09:07.159
I'm gonna hit Control C, Control V.

214
00:09:07.159 --> 00:09:09.350
We'll just move this up.

215
00:09:09.350 --> 00:09:13.830
And we are going to have to get rid of these two

216
00:09:13.830 --> 00:09:18.730
because we want the far dirt tile

217
00:09:18.730 --> 00:09:21.389
and the far grass tile.

218
00:09:21.389 --> 00:09:22.769
So let's just put the dirt down here

219
00:09:22.769 --> 00:09:23.769
and the grass up here.

220
00:09:23.769 --> 00:09:27.330
So we're gonna plug this in like so, far dirt.

221
00:09:27.330 --> 00:09:30.009
And there is our, I should say far grass.

222
00:09:30.009 --> 00:09:35.299
And we're gonna call this one BC underscore far grass

223
00:09:36.299 --> 00:09:42.419
and BC underscore far dirt.

224
00:09:43.139 --> 00:09:44.340
So there we go.

225
00:09:44.340 --> 00:09:47.379
And then we're going to take this lerp

226
00:09:47.379 --> 00:09:50.120
and I'm gonna hit Control C, Control V.

227
00:09:50.120 --> 00:09:53.120
All right, and we're gonna take the output from this one

228
00:09:53.120 --> 00:09:54.679
and plug that into here.

229
00:09:54.679 --> 00:09:56.320
And then we're gonna take the output from this one

230
00:09:56.320 --> 00:09:58.440
and plug it in like so.

231
00:09:58.440 --> 00:10:00.779
And then we're gonna look for our named reroute

232
00:10:00.779 --> 00:10:02.820
of our distance blend.

233
00:10:02.820 --> 00:10:05.360
And we're gonna plug that in.

234
00:10:05.360 --> 00:10:07.139
And once that is done,

