236
00:10:11.769 --> 00:10:14.169
So now what we have here,

237
00:10:14.169 --> 00:10:16.809
let me just kind of move this out of the way a little bit

238
00:10:16.809 --> 00:10:18.610
is we have, again, let's go over this.

239
00:10:18.610 --> 00:10:21.889
So we have our far grass tile and our far grass

240
00:10:21.889 --> 00:10:24.250
and our far dirt tile and our far dirt.

241
00:10:24.250 --> 00:10:26.850
And again, we're using the lerp based off of the slope.

242
00:10:26.850 --> 00:10:28.529
So whatever we set here for the slope

243
00:10:28.529 --> 00:10:32.210
