245
00:10:35.620 --> 00:10:40.370
And then for our near grass and our near dirt,

246
00:10:40.370 --> 00:10:42.149
what we're gonna do is the same thing.

247
00:10:42.149 --> 00:10:44.009
We have BC grass, BC dirt,

248
00:10:44.009 --> 00:10:45.529
we're using this linear interpolate

249
00:10:45.529 --> 00:10:48.210
along with our slope to mix the two.

250
00:10:48.210 --> 00:10:49.970
And finally, what we're gonna be doing

